{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22861","headline":"江楼早秋 · 白居易","name":"江楼早秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国虽多热，秋来亦不迟。\n湖光朝霁後，竹气晚凉时。\n楼阁宜佳客，江山入好诗。\n清风水苹叶，白露木兰枝。\n欲作云泉计，须营伏腊资。\n匡庐一步地，官满更何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}